ml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(469,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(536,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> hybrid orbital from each boron atom overlaps with the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.192ex\" height=\"1.529ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 969 676\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> orbital of the hydrogen. This gives a delocalised molecular orbital covering all three nuclei, containing one pair of electrons and making up one of the bridges. This is a three-centre two-electron bond <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.822ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3899.4 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1544.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2544.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3044.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3510.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2017 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - p-Block Elements Question 65 English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lhya7ytc/426f78d8-f7f4-4d27-9186-dacd6e8613f6/ea542000-f84f-11ed-a781-6b119f5e0ecf/file-1lhya7ytd.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"><br><b>Option (D)</b>: Group 13 elements have only three valency electrons. When these are used to form three covalent bonds, the atom has a share in only six electrons. The compounds are therefore electron deficient. In <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.576ex\" height=\"1.994ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2464.6 881.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(1028,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1750,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2061,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, effective <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.296ex\" height=\"1ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 573 442\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> overlap takes place between <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.138ex\" height=\"1.439ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 503 636\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> orbitals of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.326ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 1028 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.643ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1000 726\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> due to their comparable size while in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.852ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2144.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1430,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1741,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.296ex\" height=\"1ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 573 442\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> overlap is not effective as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.138ex\" height=\"1.439ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 503 636\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> orbital of boron is smaller than that of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.138ex\" height=\"1.439ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 503 636\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> orbital of chlorine, hence, the acidity of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.852ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2144.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1430,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1741,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is greater than that of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.576ex\" height=\"1.994ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2464.6 881.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:hre